    <string name="privacy_text">This app collects no data. No accounts, no analytics, no ads.\n\nIt has no INTERNET permission, so your data cannot leave the phone. Exports go only where you choose.\n\nPermissions:\n• USE_BIOMETRIC: optional app lock only.\n• WAKE_LOCK, ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED: used by the Jetpack widget library; never to send data.\n\nFound a security problem? Please report it privately through a GitHub security advisory.</string>
